      },
      "lineNbr": 222,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000006
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-27T06:04:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So for this the entry in the voltha.yml should have been:\n\ncoordinator:\n    membership_watch_relatch_delay: 0.1\n\nAnd hence in __init__ we shall have the code:\n    self.membership_watch_relatch_delay \u003d config.get(\u0027membership_watch_relatch_delay\u0027, 0.1)\n\nAnd hence in this line we can just use:\n    self.membership_watch_relatch_delay\n\nThis comment applies to the other configurable time constants.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 222,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 222,
        "endChar": 76
      },
      "revId": "999e47ee023dc758edef363386c29311e87cdcea",
